  "releaseNotes": "# Extend0.MetadataEntry.Generator\n\n\t\t\tA high-performance C# source generator that produces compact metadata entry structures used by Extend0 metadata framework at compile-time using `[assembly: GenerateMetadataEntry(key, value)]` attributes.\n\n\t\t\t## Features\n\n\t\t\t- Generates efficient value-type structs (`MetadataEntry{K}x{V}`) for (key, value) pairs at compile-time.\n\t\t\t- Emits an optimized enum of variants with extension helpers.\n\t\t\t- Produces a centralized `MetadataCell` wrapper for efficient dispatching.\n\t\t\t- Minimal reflection, no runtime cost.\n\t\t\t- Integrates seamlessly into build pipeline via Roslyn incremental generation.",
